"Tap-to-Radar will automatically attach diagnostic data from IntelligencePlatform including feature values, metadata and relevance rankings for entities (e.g. people and events) in your personal on-device knowledge graph.  In addition, if you consent, (i) relationship tagging diagnostic data including feature values, rankings, names of ranked individuals in your knowledge graph, and predicted tags (mother, father, coworker, etc.), and (ii) event diagnostic data including dates, location and names of event data in your knowledge graph will be saved. You may choose not to send us these. However, in the event that you choose not to provide the full data set, there is a possibility that your issue may not be fully triaged.\n"
